# ::tok “The delay in publishing the protocols harms the transparency of the decisions; because of this, the ability of the bidders – patient organizations and pharmaceutical companies – to submit repeated applications as soon as possible and relevant, after they have learned from the rejection of their proposals, analyzed the reasons for their failure in the previous round, improved and corrected their proposals and carried out a renewed assessment regarding the possibility of accepting them in the next round”, the comptroller noted in the report.
